4	 * the handler implementations be built in parallel against the same types.
5	 *
6	 * Conventions:
7	 *   - All money is integer cents (field names end in Cents).
8	 *   - Dates are ISO strings (YYYY-MM-DD); timestamps are epoch millis (asOf, ts).
9	 *   - Every response that reflects tenant state is implicitly scoped to the
10	 *     authenticated user_id resolved by the AuthProvider; user_id is never a
