106	   * rolled up over descendants (additive field). For a leaf this equals
107	   * carryoverCents; for a parent it is the parent's own carryover only (the
108	   * rolled carryoverCents also folds in every child's carryover). Every
109	   * carryover ADJUSTMENT edits this own value, so all carryover controls
110	   * (grid popover, detail adjuster, history inline Edit) must base on it, not
